          "distinct": true,
          "id": "566776363168fdaeb503f6ae6d7cb7a8403750b4",
          "message": "fix(solid): keep bare scheme:// graphs out of the auth view (#6939)\n\n* fix(solid): keep bare scheme:// graphs out of the auth view\n\nA graph named by a bare `scheme://` (no authority) was seeded as a resource,\nso the parent rule's textual scrape made it the container of every pod root\nand its control document applied across origins. The loader now skips such\ngraphs and their `.acl`/`.acr`, matching `parent_iri`, which already stops at\nthe authority root.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C1gMf8RJim1LzuKapZNpZR\n\n* fix(solid): match only an exact scheme:// in the authority-root check\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C1gMf8RJim1LzuKapZNpZR\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>",
