          "distinct": true,
          "id": "5e171b378d0a5fe817c09a9042a5cc71f26fd9d7",
          "message": "fix(fedclient): strict term rendering and expression validation in pushdown (#6949)\n\n* fix(fedclient): strict term rendering and expression validation in pushdown\n\nVALUES cells are typed terms rendered through the strict term renderer,\nORDER BY keys are typed variables with a direction, and a filter\nconjunct is pushed only when its text parses as exactly one expression\nover its declared variables without EXISTS; otherwise it stays local.\n\nRefs #6880\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C1gMf8RJim1LzuKapZNpZR\n\n* fix(fedclient): keep local-filter variables projected and the limit local\n\nA conjunct evaluated locally now keeps the group variables it references\nin the sub-query projection, and LIMIT is pushed only when every\nconjunct is pushed. Filter text with a \\u or \\U code-point escape is\nkept local, since an endpoint expands those before parsing.\n\nRefs #6880\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C1gMf8RJim1LzuKapZNpZR\n\n* fix(fedclient): project every group variable when a conjunct stays local\n\nAn EXISTS in a local conjunct can correlate on group variables the\nconjunct does not declare, so any local conjunct now keeps the whole\ngroup projection.\n\nRefs #6880\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C1gMf8RJim1LzuKapZNpZR\n\n* fix(fedclient): write literals with ECHAR escapes only\n\nThe strict term renderer now serialises literals itself, using only\nECHAR escapes, and refuses a value an endpoint's \\u/\\U code-point\npreprocessing would change. Directional language tags are kept.\n\nRefs #6880\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C1gMf8RJim1LzuKapZNpZR\n\n* test(fedclient): check rendered literals survive code-point preprocessing\n\nAlso documents that a VALUES render error keeps the bind join local.\n\nRefs #6880\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C1gMf8RJim1LzuKapZNpZR\n\n* fix(fedclient): refuse only literals holding a complete code-point escape\n\nEscape-like text such as \\u12 or \\uZZZZ is left unchanged by an\nendpoint's preprocessing, so it renders as before.\n\nRefs #6880\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C1gMf8RJim1LzuKapZNpZR\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>",
