          "id": "39aa6c3174784f0c8d81e50438eb44468ba48f2a",
          "message": "feat(n3): premise universals in N3 query documents (#7290)\n\nAn N3 query rule's own premise @forAll is matched against store universals on the same terms as a forward rule, through the shared independence check. A query is still refused when the data or the query has backward rules.\n\nAddresses #6882",
